{"text": "11 + 13 is 24, but then I have 12 and 1 left.", "start": 683, "end": 728, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "If I subtract them, 12 -1 is 11, but 24 + 11 is 35, which is too big.", "start": 729, "end": 798, "label": "inform"}
