{"text": "Another approach: Let's see, 12 is a good number because it's half of 24.", "start": 1030, "end": 1103, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "If I can get 12 multiplied by 2, but how?", "start": 1104, "end": 1145, "label": "setQuestion"}
{"text": "Let's see.", "start": 1146, "end": 1156, "label": "stalling"}
{"text": "If I have 13 -11 = 2, then 12 * (13 -11) = 12*2=24.", "start": 1157, "end": 1208, "label": "inform"}
