{"text": "Not helpful.", "start": 1566, "end": 1578, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What if I do 13 - (12 / (something))?", "start": 1580, "end": 1617, "label": "setQuestion"}
{"text": "Let's see.", "start": 1618, "end": 1628, "label": "stalling"}
